From 5e62fd22daf2bf1fd8df4e3b8143141331b778b7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Strata Orin Port <orin-port@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 07:19:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] memory: budget ARM integrated CUDA allocations from
 shared physical RAM

Use cgroup-bounded MemAvailable minus headroom, limited by CUDA total, for aarch64 integrated GPUs. Keep other devices on their v0.1.45 accounting. Apply the same budget to Qwen3.6 placement/chunk queries: that path did not exist in the fork. Keep cudaMalloc, pinned mapping and v0.1.45 model loading and kernel dispatch.
